# 中频词汇 List10
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List10核心词汇

{{extraordinary}}{/ɪkˈstrɔːdnri/}{非凡的；特别的}{She showed extraordinary courage during the crisis.}}
{{extreme}}{/ɪkˈstriːm/}{极端的；极度的}{Extreme weather events are becoming more frequent.}}
{{fabric}}{/ˈfæbrɪk/}{织物；结构}{The social fabric of the community has been strengthened.}}
{{fade}}{/feɪd/}{褪色；消退}{The memories of childhood gradually faded.}}
{{failure}}{/ˈfeɪljər/}{失败；故障}{Failure is often the first step toward success.}}
{{fame}}{/feɪm/}{名声；声誉}{The scientist gained fame for her groundbreaking research.}}
{{fantasy}}{/ˈfæntəsi/}{幻想；想象}{The novel is a work of fantasy set in a magical world.}}
{{fatal}}{/ˈfeɪtl/}{致命的；灾难性的}{The accident was fatal for the driver.}}
{{fate}}{/feɪt/}{命运；天数}{She believed that fate had brought them together.}}
{{fault}}{/fɔːlt/}{过错；缺陷}{It was not her fault that the project failed.}}
{{favor}}{/ˈfeɪvər/}{赞成；好处}{The decision was made in favor of the environment.}}
{{feasible}}{/ˈfiːzəbl/}{可行的；可能的}{The plan is technically feasible but expensive.}}
{{feature}}{/ˈfiːtʃər/}{特征；以...为特色}{The new model features improved battery life.}}
{{fierce}}{/fɪəs/}{激烈的；凶猛的}{Competition in the tech industry is fierce.}}
{{figure}}{/ˈfɪɡər/}{数字；人物；身材}{The report includes several important figures and statistics.}}
{{file}}{/faɪl/}{文件；档案}{Please save the document as a PDF file.}}
{{finance}}{/ˈfaɪnæns/}{金融；资助}{The project was financed by the government.}}
{{fiscal}}{/ˈfɪskl/}{财政的；国库的}{The government announced new fiscal policies.}}
{{flaw}}{/flɔː/}{缺陷；瑕疵}{The study was criticized for methodological flaws.}}
{{flee}}{/fliː/}{逃跑；逃离}{Thousands of refugees fled the war-torn country.}}
{{flourish}}{/ˈflʌrɪʃ/}{繁荣；兴旺}{Small businesses can flourish in a supportive environment.}}
{{folk}}{/fəʊk/}{民间的；人们}{Folk music reflects the cultural heritage of a region.}}
{{forecast}}{/ˈfɔːkɑːst/}{预测；预报}{The economic forecast suggests moderate growth.}}
{{forge}}{/fɔːdʒ/}{锻造；伪造}{The two nations forged a strong alliance.}}
{{formal}}{/ˈfɔːml/}{正式的；正规的}{A formal agreement was signed between the two parties.}}
{{format}}{/ˈfɔːmæt/}{格式；版式}{The book is available in both digital and print formats.}}
{{former}}{/ˈfɔːmər/}{以前的；前者}{The former president gave a speech at the ceremony.}}
{{foster}}{/ˈfɒstər/}{培养；促进}{Schools should foster critical thinking in students.}}
{{fraction}}{/ˈfrækʃn/}{分数；一小部分}{Only a fraction of applicants are accepted.}}
{{fragile}}{/ˈfrædʒaɪl/}{脆弱的；易碎的}{The economy remains fragile after the recession.}}
